  "description": "A modern, fully accessible emoji picker component for Blazor WebAssembly and Server applications. Features include live search, category organization, recent emoji tracking, WCAG 2.1 AA compliance (approaching AAA), full keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and programmatic dark mode with system preference detection.",
